Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-07-2001||02:20 PM||||WEll Greg had the motor in and limping last time i saw him. since then he has installed a Haltech E6K and was horribley mislead on his timing. running nearly 40*!!! well Ed spent a few minutes on the Dyno and realized that greg had Boost issues.. Greg fixed said issues and then the tuning began... they spent 4 hours running and tweaking and turning and programming. Gregs still not happy with the boost that he's running but a friend (William-NOS Focus)that was at NOPI (on the way out of the shop) said Greg was apparently not used to the high torque and lit up the tires a couple times and dropped off the fuel.. well they said it looked like he didn't mean to do it...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  can't wait to see what he runs with the right boost and fuel issues worked out.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/g11.gif">  <P>super sweet ride ya got Greg! sorry i couldn't make it downt here...<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
