Z||000005||GTallen||03-12-2001||12:19 AM||||Thanks for the comments.<P>I installed the 2.0 ratio (3.4") pulley from Thrasher-ep.com  In their setups they got 11 psi out of it. I only saw 8 psi.  I think there are better setups available.  All the others offer interchangable pulleys for different ratios.||||reg||1
